<title>USA: Ill. riverboat revenues down 8.18 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Ill. riverboat revenues down 8.18 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revenues from the Illinois riverboat casinos dropped 8.18 percent in April from the month before and were down 14.18 percent compared to a year ago, the Illinois Gaming Board reported.</p>
<p>The boats took in $89.22 million in April compared to $97.16 million in March and $103.96 million in April 1996, the board reported.</p>
<p>((--David Bailey, 312-408-8647))</p>
